mechanism from ignorable given the proxy (\code{phi = 0}, MAR) to depending only on the
outcome (\code{phi = 1}). Evaluated over a grid of \code{phi}, the adjusted means form an
\emph{ignorance interval} to read alongside the sampling confidence interval; see
\code{\link[=nr_sensitivity]{nr_sensitivity()}} and the report block.
}
\details{
